  (@custom "contractspecv0" (after data) "\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05admin\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05asset\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\13\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01ODeployed risk configuration: `(c_factor, target_hf, min_hf, orange_hf)`,\0aall 1e7-scaled.\0a\0aRead-only view for off-chain consumers (frontend, keeper, monitoring), so\0athey act on the on-chain thresholds rather than copies of deploy values.\0a`c_factor` is the configured one; the HF uses the lower of it and the\0apool's (see `risk_factors`).\00\00\00\00\06config\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\03\ed\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\0b\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\dbWithdraw by share count: burn exactly `shares` of `from`'s and pay what\0athey are worth to `to`. Returns the underlying paid.\0a\0a`withdraw` takes an amount of underlying and refuses one worth more than\0athe caller's shares. The share price moves every ledger, so a holder\0acannot reliably ask it for everything they hold; here they pass their\0ashare balance and nothing is left behind. Sized and rounded like\0a`withdraw`, against the withdrawer. The DeFindex trait has no such call.\00\00\00\00\06redeem\00\00\00\00\00\03\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06shares\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04from\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02to\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\0b\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\8dQuery the underlying asset balance for an address.\0a\0abalance = caller_shares / (total_shares + unvested_shares) \c3\97\0a(supply_value - debt_value)\00\00\00\00\00\00\07balance\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04from\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\0b\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\95Deposit underlying asset, lever it in, mint shares.\0a\0aFlow:\0a1. Transfer `amount` from `from` to the strategy contract\0a2. Lever it in: one SupplyCollateral + Borrow submit, sized to land on\0a`target_hf` (`compute_lever_in`). Blend refuses the borrow if it would\0asettle the reserve above its own `max_util`.\0a3. Check what the pool settled: HF >= `min_hf`\0a4. Price the equity the b/d token deltas add, mint proportional shares\0a5. Return the depositor's underlying balance\0a\0aThe first deposit gives up `FIRST_DEPOSIT_LOCKUP` shares to the lockup,\0aso only the keeper or the admin may make it; anyone else is refused with\0a`NotAuthorized` until the vault has been seeded.\00\00\00\00\00\00\07deposit\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06amount\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04from\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\0b\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00Harvest BLND emissions, swap to underlying, re-leverage.\0a\0aCallable only by the keeper. Claims from both supply and borrow emission\0asides, swaps BLND \e2\86\92 underlying via Soroswap, then re-leverages proceeds.\0aNo share tokens are minted: the proceeds raise per-share equity gradually,\0aas the shares they are priced at vest over `PROFIT_UNLOCK_LEDGERS` (see\0a`reserves::harvest`).\0a\0aRefused while a split harvest is awaiting settlement: this path would\0aswap the pending claim's BLND and lever the proceeds in the same call,\0aleaving `harvest_reinvest` to measure a settlement whose underlying has\0aalready gone into the pool. Settle through `harvest_reinvest` (which\0acovers the Soroswap route) rather than interleaving the two. Refused too\0awhile the previous harvest's shares are vesting (`check_vested`).\0a\0a**The swap always runs with a floor** (see `blend_pool::perform_reinvest`):\0athe stricter of the keeper's `amount_out_min`, optionally carried in\0a`data` as 16 big-endian bytes, and the admin's `min_harvest_rate` priced\0aover the\00\00\00\07harvest\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04from\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\03\e8\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\07upgrade\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dnew_wasm_hash\00\00\00\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00 \00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00?Current contract version (1 at deploy, bumped on each upgrade).\00\00\00\00\07version\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\0bGet current strategy position details.\0aReturns (total_equity, total_shares, b_tokens, d_tokens, b_rate, d_rate).\0a\0a`total_equity` is the whole position's, harvest profit not yet vested\0aincluded; shares are priced at `total_equity / (total_shares +\0aunvested_shares())`.\00\00\00\00\08position\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\03\ed\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\0b\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00FThe intermediate token of the on-chain Soroswap harvest route, if any.\00\00\00\00\00\08swap_via\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e8\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\01'Withdraw underlying by unwinding proportional leverage.\0a\0aFlow:\0a1. Calculate proportional b/d tokens for the requested amount\0a2. Submit unwind: repay proportional debt, withdraw proportional collateral\0a3. Burn shares, transfer equity to `to`\0a4. Return the depositor's remaining underlying balance\00\00\00\00\08withdraw\00\00\00\03\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06amount\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04from\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02to\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\0b\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\e5Rebalance: partial-unwind if HF is in the orange zone (HF < orange_hf),\0arestoring HF to `orange_hf + REBALANCE_HF_BUFFER`. Callable by anyone\0a(permissionless \e2\80\94 protects the vault). Emits a `rebalance` event when debt\0ais repaid.\00\00\00\00\00\00\09rebalance\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\09set_admin\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\09new_admin\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\1fGet the current keeper address.\00\00\00\00\0aget_keeper\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\13\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00Keeper-gated re-leverage: borrow against collateral the vault already\0aholds, supply it straight back, and restore the leverage ratio toward\0a`target_hf`. Returns the underlying borrowed (`0` on a no-op).\0a\0aThe only path that adds leverage to the existing position: `rebalance`,\0a`rebalance_keeper` and `partial_unwind` remove it, and `deposit`,\0a`harvest` and `harvest_reinvest` lever only the capital they bring in.\0a\0aEquity is untouched \e2\80\94 the borrow and the supply are the same amount, so\0a`B \e2\88\92 D` is invariant and no share price moves. What changes is the ratio\0athe vault earns on.\0a\0a**What bounds it.** Adding leverage is the unsafe direction, so the keeper\0agets no discretion over the amount (unlike `partial_unwind`, where the\0akeeper's target is trusted precisely because it can only make the position\0asafer). The target is fixed on-chain:\0a\0a- it is `target_hf`, the HF a fresh deposit lands at. HF and leverage are\0athe same statement, so this *is* the \22never exceed the configured\0aleverage\22 cap;\0a- `target_hf` sits at lea\00\00\00\0areleverage\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\0b\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\e2Set a new keeper address (keeper self-rotation).\0a\0aGated by the *current* keeper. This is one of two ways to rotate the\0akeeper; see `admin_set_keeper` for the admin recovery path used when the\0akeeper key is lost or compromised.\00\00\00\00\00\0aset_keeper\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0anew_keeper\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00^The SEP-41 share token this strategy deployed at construction, and is\0athe admin and minter of.\00\00\00\00\00\0bshare_token\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\13\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01SLive risk factors behind the health factor:\0a`(strategy_c_factor, pool_c_factor, pool_l_factor)`, all 1e7-scaled.\0a\0aRead-only view for operators and monitoring. The pool values are fetched\0afrom the reserve config on every call, so a Blend governance change shows\0ahere as soon as it lands. The HF uses `min(strategy_c_factor,\0apool_c_factor)`.\00\00\00\00\0crisk_factors\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\03\ed\00\00\00\03\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\0b\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01}Route the on-chain Soroswap harvest swap through `via` \e2\80\94 BLND \e2\86\92 via \e2\86\92\0aunderlying \e2\80\94 or straight BLND \e2\86\92 underlying with `None` (admin-gated).\0a\0aFor an underlying with no BLND pair on Soroswap (CETES, USTRY) or a thin\0aone (XLM), the route through a deep intermediate (USDC) is the one that\0aworks, or pays. The swap's floor prices the BLND, not the route, so it is\0aunaffected.\00\00\00\00\00\00\0cset_swap_via\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\03via\00\00\00\03\e8\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00:The configured swap account, or `NotInitialized` if unset.\00\00\00\00\00\0cswap_account\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\13\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00Initialize the strategy with configuration.\0a\0ainit_args layout:\0a[0] pool: Address          \e2\80\94 Blend pool\0a[1] blend_token: Address   \e2\80\94 BLND token\0a[2] router: Address        \e2\80\94 Soroswap router\0a[3] reward_threshold: i128 \e2\80\94 min BLND to trigger harvest\0a[4] keeper: Address        \e2\80\94 authorized harvest caller\0a[5] c_factor: i128         \e2\80\94 collateral factor (1e7)\0a[6] target_hf: i128        \e2\80\94 health factor deposits are levered to (1e7)\0a[7] min_hf: i128           \e2\80\94 minimum health factor (1e7)\0a[8] orange_hf: i128        \e2\80\94 orange-zone threshold; partial unwind triggered below this (1e7)\0a[9] admin: Address         \e2\80\94 authorized to upgrade the contract\0a[10] share_token_wasm: BytesN<32> \e2\80\94 uploaded `vault_share` wasm hash\0a[11] share_name: String    \e2\80\94 share token name\0a[12] share_symbol: String  \e2\80\94 share token symbol\0a\0aThe strategy deploys its own share token, as both its admin and its\0aminter, so the token and its minter are fixed from construction: no\0alater call can repoint the strategy at another token, or \00\00\00\0d__constructor\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05asset\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\09init_args\00\00\00\00\00\03\ea\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00Keeper-gated: claim BLND emissions into the strategy and approve the swap\0aaccount to pull them for an off-chain Broker swap. The BLND stays in the\0acontract until pulled, so the on-chain Soroswap path remains a valid\0afallback. Returns the BLND balance available to swap.\0a\0a**The approval is not unconditional.** Granting it records a\0a`PendingHarvest`: how much BLND became pullable, the underlying balance\0abefore any proceeds could arrive, and the minimum underlying owed back at\0athe admin's `min_harvest_rate`. `harvest_reinvest` will not settle the\0aharvest unless the measured proceeds clear that floor \e2\80\94 see there for the\0ameasurement. Two conditions gate the approval, and failing either leaves\0athe BLND in the contract for the Soroswap route rather than erroring:\0a\0a- a `swap_account` is set (who may pull), and\0a- a `min_harvest_rate` is set (what they owe back).\0a\0aClaiming while a previous claim's allowance is still live is rejected:\0atwo overlapping approvals would let more BLND out than the newer floor\0acovers. Once t\00\00\00\0dharvest_claim\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\0b\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01,Get current health factor (1e7 scaled).\0a\0aExpressed in Blend's own terms: the collateral side is weighted by the\0astrategy's `c_factor` (capped at the pool's live one) and the debt side\0acarries the pool's live `l_factor`, so 1.0 here is the liquidation\0athreshold, not an optimistic approximation of it.\00\00\00\0dhealth_factor\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\0b\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\03jKeeper-only partial unwind: if HF is below `target_hf`, repay just enough\0adebt to bring it there. Unlike `rebalance` it acts at any HF below the\0atarget, inside the orange zone or not, so the keeper can take leverage off\0aahead of a move it expects. Anyone else protects the vault through\0a`rebalance`. Emits a `rebalance` event with the keeper as caller when debt\0ais repaid. Returns the underlying repaid.\0a\0aThe keeper's authorization is required before anything else, so it is\0aspent even by a call that turns out to be a no-op: a signed call sent\0awhile the vault has no debt cannot be replayed later, by anyone, at a\0amoment of their choosing.\0a\0a`target_hf` is used as given, and refused with `InvalidArgument` below the\0arebalance target (`orange_hf + REBALANCE_HF_BUFFER`): landing nearer the\0atrigger would re-arm it on the next accrual, the churn the buffer exists\0ato prevent.\00\00\00\00\00\0epartial_unwind\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\09target_hf\00\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\0b\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01_The claim awaiting settlement as `(blnd_claimed, underlying_before,\0afloor, approval_expiration)`, or an error when none is in flight.\0a\0aRead-only view of the obligation the next `harvest_reinvest` has to\0aclear, so the keeper and monitoring can see an unsettled claim (and the\0aledger at which its allowance expires) rather than inferring it from\0aevents.\00\00\00\00\0fpending_harvest\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\03\ed\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\04\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02FChange the risk parameters (admin-gated), under the constructor's own\0avalidation against the pool's live reserve config \e2\80\94 notably\0a`c_factor <= pool c_factor`, so a Blend governance cut can be followed\0awithin its timelock.\0a\0aTakes effect at once: new deposits and harvests lever to the new\0a`target_hf`; `releverage` moves the existing position toward it when it\0ais lower, the keeper's `partial_unwind` when it is higher; and a higher\0a`orange_hf` can make the position eligible for `rebalance` immediately.\0aEmits `risk_params` with the new `(c_factor, target_hf, min_hf,\0aorange_hf)`.\00\00\00\00\00\0fset_risk_params\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\08c_factor\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\09target_hf\00\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06min_hf\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\09orange_hf\00\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\86Shares harvest profit was minted as, still vesting to the holders (see\0a`PROFIT_UNLOCK_LEDGERS`). Not part of the share token's supply.\00\00\00\00\00\0funvested_shares\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\0b\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\0fAdmin recovery path to rotate the keeper (gated by the `admin-sep` admin).\0a\0aComplements `set_keeper`: the keeper rotates itself in normal operation,\0abut if the keeper key is lost or compromised the admin can install a new\0akeeper here without the old keeper's cooperation.\00\00\00\00\10admin_set_keeper\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0anew_keeper\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00Keeper-gated: re-leverage harvested proceeds via the chosen route.\0a\0a- `via_soroswap = true`: swap the strategy's BLND \e2\86\92 underlying on-chain\0athrough Soroswap, under the same floor as the trait `harvest` (the\0astricter of `amount_out_min` and the admin's `min_harvest_rate`), then\0are-leverage.\0a- `via_soroswap = false` (Broker): the keeper has already swapped off-chain\0aand transferred `amount_in` of underlying back to the strategy; re-leverage\0ait directly (asserted to be held). `amount_out_min` is ignored here.\0a\0a**Settlement floor.** This call closes out the `PendingHarvest` opened by\0a`harvest_claim`, measured on two balances the contract reads itself\0arather than on `amount_in`, which says nothing about where the\0aunderlying came from:\0a\0a- `spent` \e2\80\94 BLND the claim made pullable, minus what is still here.\0aHowever much left, by whatever route, is what is owed for.\0a- `delivered` \e2\80\94 underlying held now over the claim-time baseline, plus\0athe on-chain swap's output when this call is the one that swapped.\0a\0a`delivered`\00\00\00\10harvest_reinvest\00\00\00\03\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\09amount_in\00\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0cvia_soroswap\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0eamount_out_min\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\0b\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00zThe configured settlement floor rate, or an error if unset (Broker path\0aclosed). See `set_min_harvest_rate` for the units.\00\00\00\00\00\10min_harvest_rate\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\0b\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\14Keeper-authorised auto-rebalance: `rebalance`, attributed to the keeper.\0aRepays just enough debt to bring HF back to `orange_hf +\0aREBALANCE_HF_BUFFER` when it has dropped into the orange zone; emits a\0a`rebalance` event with the keeper as caller, before/after HF and the\0aunderlying repaid. Returns the underlying repaid.\0a\0aNot rate-limited, and nothing would be gained by it: `rebalance` offers\0athe same unwind to anyone, and the unwind limits itself \e2\80\94 it acts only\0abelow `orange_hf` and lands above it, so a repeat call is a no-op.\00\00\00\10rebalance_keeper\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\0b\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01>Set the keeper-controlled account allowed to pull claimed BLND for an\0aoff-chain swap (admin-gated).\0a\0aRevokes the outgoing account's allowance first, so a removed account\0acannot pull a claim in flight. That claim stays pending: settle it through\0a`harvest_reinvest`, or let it expire and claim again for the new account.\00\00\00\00\00\10set_swap_account\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\07account\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00Set the harvest floor rate (admin-gated): the minimum underlying the\0avault will accept back per `SCALAR_7` of BLND it gives up, both in\0asmallest units.\0a\0aOne rate governs both harvest routes. On the off-chain (Broker) path it\0ais the settlement floor `harvest_reinvest` measures the returned\0aunderlying against; on the on-chain Soroswap swap (trait `harvest`, and\0a`harvest_reinvest` with `via_soroswap`) it becomes the swap's\0a`amount_out_min` when the caller supplies no stricter one of its own.\0a\0aIt is a floor, not a price \e2\80\94 set it well below the market BLND rate (a\0athird to a half is a reasonable starting point) so ordinary spread, Broker\0afee and price drift between claim and settle never trip it, and it binds\0aonly when a settlement comes back materially short of what the BLND was\0aworth.\0a\0aConsequences of getting it wrong are asymmetric and both recoverable:\0atoo high and the harvest reverts until the admin lowers it (yield\0apauses, nothing is lost); too low and the floor stops catching small\0ashortfalls. Review it w\00\00\00\14set_min_harvest_rate\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04rate\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00XChange the minimum BLND balance a harvest swaps (admin-gated). Emits\0a`reward_threshold`.\00\00\00\14set_reward_threshold\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\10reward_threshold\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06Config\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00 The underlying asset (e.g. USDC)\00\00\00\05asset\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\12BLND token address\00\00\00\00\00\0bblend_token\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00yCollateral factor (1e7 scaled, e.g. 9_500_000 = 0.95). Health-factor\0amath uses the lower of this and the pool's live one.\00\00\00\00\00\00\08c_factor\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00*Emission claim IDs (supply + borrow sides)\00\00\00\00\00\09claim_ids\00\00\00\00\00\03\ea\00\00\00\04\00\00\009Minimum health factor (1e7 scaled, e.g. 1_050_000 = 1.05)\00\00\00\00\00\00\06min_hf\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\81Orange-zone threshold: HF below this triggers partial unwind (1e7 scaled).\0aMust satisfy min_hf < orange_hf. e.g. 1_150_000 = 1.15\00\00\00\00\00\00\09orange_hf\00\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\12Blend pool address\00\00\00\00\00\04pool\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\19Reserve index in the pool\00\00\00\00\00\00\0areserve_id\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00,Minimum BLND balance to trigger harvest swap\00\00\00\10reward_threshold\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\17Soroswap router address\00\00\00\00\06router\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\01#Health factor a deposit is levered to (1e7 scaled, e.g. 11_300_000 =\0a1.13), in Blend's terms: the pool's live `l_factor` is part of it. It is\0athe vault's leverage, `B/E = target_hf / (target_hf \e2\88\92 c_factor \c3\97 l_factor)`.\0aAt least `orange_hf + RELEVERAGE_HF_BUFFER` (`validate_risk_params`).\00\00\00\00\09target_hf\00\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\07DataKey\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06Config\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0bTotalShares\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06Keeper\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\003Monotonic contract version, bumped on each upgrade.\00\00\00\00\07Version\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\90The SEP-41 vault-share token contract \e2\80\94 the canonical per-user share\0aledger. The strategy is its minter (mints on deposit, burns on withdraw).\00\00\00\0aShareToken\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00CLedger sequence of the last keeper re-leverage (for rate-limiting).\00\00\00\00\0eLastReleverage\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00|Keeper-controlled account allowed to pull claimed BLND for an off-chain\0a(Stellar Broker) swap during the split harvest flow.\00\00\00\0bSwapAccount\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\85Minimum underlying the vault will accept per `SCALAR_7` of BLND when an\0aoff-chain harvest settles (admin-set). Gates the Broker path.\00\00\00\00\00\00\0eMinHarvestRate\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00HThe in-flight `harvest_claim` awaiting settlement by `harvest_reinvest`.\00\00\00\0ePendingHarvest\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00?Shares minted for harvest profit, still vesting to the holders.\00\00\00\00\0eUnvestedShares\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00lOptional intermediate token of the on-chain Soroswap harvest route\0a(BLND \e2\86\92 via \e2\86\92 underlying), admin-set.\00\00\00\07SwapVia\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\01\80A `harvest_claim` whose BLND has been approved to the swap account and whose\0aproceeds have not yet been settled by `harvest_reinvest`.\0a\0aThe record is what ties the two halves of the split harvest together: it\0apins how much BLND was pullable, what the underlying balance was before any\0aof it could come back, and the minimum that must return. Single-use \e2\80\94 the\0asettling call takes it.\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0ePendingHarvest\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00FBLND held by the strategy at claim time \e2\80\94 the whole approved amount.\00\00\00\00\00\0cblnd_claimed\00\00\00\0b\00\00\005Ledger at which the swap account's allowance expires.\00\00\00\00\00\00\0aexpiration\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00zMinimum underlying owed back if the whole `blnd_claimed` is pulled.\0aProrated at settlement by how much BLND actually left.\00\00\00\00\00\05floor\00\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\cfUnderlying held at claim time, the baseline the settlement is measured\0aagainst. Idle underlying is normally ~0 (deposits are levered in the\0asame call), so growth over this baseline *is* the harvest proceeds.\00\00\00\00\11underlying_before\00\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\01\0bShares a harvest's profit was minted as, held by no one: `amount` at ledger\0a`start`, vesting linearly to none at ledger `end` (see\0a`PROFIT_UNLOCK_LEDGERS`). They are priced alongside the holders' shares\0auntil they vest, and are never part of the share token's supply.\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0eUnvestedShares\00\00\00\00\00\03\00\00\00(Shares still unvested at ledger `start`.\00\00\00\06amount\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00+Ledger by which all of `amount` has vested.\00\00\00\00\03end\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00!Ledger the schedule was last set.\00\00\00\00\00\00\05start\00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0eNotInitialized\00\00\00\00\01\91\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\12NegativeNotAllowed\00\00\00\00\01\9a\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0fInvalidArgument\00\00\00\01\9b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\13InsufficientBalance\00\00\00\01\9c\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\11UnderflowOverflow\00\00\00\00\00\01\9d\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0fArithmeticError\00\00\00\01\9e\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0eDivisionByZero\00\00\00\00\01\9f\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\13InvalidSharesMinted\00\00\00\01\a0\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\19OnlyPositiveAmountAllowed\00\00\00\00\00\01\a1\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dNotAuthorized\00\00\00\00\00\01\a2\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\17ProtocolAddressNotFound\00\00\00\01\a4\00\00\00\00\00\00